            "value": "For a routine weekly asynchronous team update, keep completed changes first, then current blockers, then the next concrete action. If a teammate must make a time-sensitive decision before the next action can proceed, put that decision request and its deadline first, then completed changes with evidence, then the next action conditional on the decision. Keep a pending decision visibly pending."
